# NAMES ONLY. Single intake: the existing GRINDCTRL Cloud environment's
# Environment variables > Manage editor. Enter actual TEST-only values there,
# never into this repository/file, chat, logs, issues or PR comments.
# GitHub Actions Secrets cannot be exported/read back into this environment.
# Keep management keys in the approved Infra workflow; none is requested here.
#
# SHOPIFY_APPS: JSON array of the legitimate A/B registrations. Each entry uses
# clientId and secret; distribution/tokenMode must reflect verified settings.
# Do not assume the checked-in registration is Custom/Public or invent B.
SHOPIFY_APPS=
# JSON array of the authorized Development Store myshopify.com domains (max 2).
GRINDCTRL_TEST_SHOPS=
# Existing isolated Clerk Development instance, sk_test_ and pk_test_ only.
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# Isolated test Redis REST credentials; never a production Redis namespace.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
# Non-secret existing approved HTTPS preview target, if one exists.
# Enter NOT_CREATED if absent: it is not a URL, approval or permission to expose
# the current local profile. No host/global/DNS management credential requested.
GRINDCTRL_TEST_PREVIEW_ORIGIN=
# Supabase local credentials, independent capability/encryption keys and bounded
# harness state are generated locally; do not supply production equivalents.
# Configure matching service hosts under Additional allowed domains in the
# environment editor; direct variables do not grant network access themselves.
